# Feature workflow

Only when the user asks to **implement a non-trivial feature** (not Q&A, typos, or one-file tweaks).

**One agent in this chat.** Do not spawn parallel explore / implement / review / Task subagents unless the user explicitly asks.

1. **PLAN** — short plan → `.ai/specs/plan.md` when non-trivial; wait for approval if a rule says so.
2. **DO** — implement; note behaviour changes in `.ai/docs/`; run `pnpm check`, `typeslint`, `slint`, `tests`.
3. **COMMIT / PUSH** — only via `/pipeline …` steps or when the user asks.

Prefer `/pipeline plan-do` (or `plan-do-commit-push`). Shared steps: `nui-workflow`. Q&A: `/ask`.
